          "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category.\nThe <TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0002>-category of categories over <MATH_0003><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\nis the <MATH_0004>-category defined as follows:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> Its objects will be functors <MATH_0005>.\n<STRUCT_0003> Its <MATH_0006>-morphisms <MATH_0007>\nwill be functors <MATH_0008> such that\n<MATH_0009>.\n<STRUCT_0004> Its <MATH_0010>-morphisms <MATH_0011> for\n<MATH_0012>\nwill be morphisms of functors\nsuch that <MATH_0013>\nfor all <MATH_0014>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nIn this situation we will denote\n<MATH_0015>\nthe category of <MATH_0016>-morphisms between\n<MATH_0017> and <MATH_0018>\n",
