          "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThere are some observations we could make here. For example if\n<MATH_0001> is a <MATH_0002>-morphism\nof categories over <MATH_0003>, then <MATH_0004> induces functors\nof fibre categories <MATH_0005>.\nSimilarly for <MATH_0006>-morphisms.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nHere is the obligatory lemma describing the <MATH_0007>-fibre product in the\n<MATH_0008>-category of categories over <MATH_0009>.\n\n",
